                    We are a European Amazon seller in the bedding category, selling across all major EU marketplaces. We are looking for a reliable part-time Customer Service VA to handle buyer messages and reviews across our Amazon stores. You will work from pre-approved templates and guidelines — this is an execution role focused on speed, accuracy, and a friendly tone. Perfect as a side role alongside other work.



Your responsibilities:

Respond to buyer messages on Amazon within 24 hours using approved templates;

Handle return and refund requests following our guidelines;

Monitor and flag negative reviews to the account manager immediately;

Use Google Translate to assist with non-English buyer messages (DE, NL, FR, IT);

Log all cases and escalate complex issues to the account manager.



Requirements

Excellent written English — warm, professional, customer-friendly tone;

Comfortable using Google Translate for multilingual messages;

Reliable — able to check and respond to messages daily (Mon–Sat);

Basic Amazon Seller Central familiarity (buyer messages, returns);

Overlap with European business hours at least a few hours per day;



To apply — please include:

1. Any customer service or Amazon messaging experience  ·  2. Your available hours and timezone  ·  3. Start your message with "SUPPORT" so we know you read this carefully.
